        "The Messenger of the Great Battles" to "Mjumbe wa Vita Vikuu",
        "Our Lord, accept this from us. Surely You are the All-Hearing, the All-Knowing." to "Mola wetu tukubalie haya. Hakika Wewe ni Mwenye kusikia, Mjuzi wa yote.",
        "Our Lord, make us both submissive to You, and from our descendants a nation submissive to You. Show us our rites of worship and accept our repentance. Surely You are the Acceptor of repentance, the Most Merciful." to "Mola wetu Mlezi! Utujaalie tuwe wanyenyekevu kwako, na kutokana na dhuria wetu tuwe umma unaonyenyekea kwako. Tuonyeshe ibada zetu na ukubali toba yetu. Hakika Wewe ni Mwingi wa kupokea toba, Mwenye kurehemu.",
        "Our Lord, give us good in this world and good in the Hereafter, and save us from the punishment of the Fire." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, tupe mema duniani na Akhera mema, na utuepushe na adhabu ya Moto.",
        "Our Lord, pour patience upon us, make our feet firm, and help us against the disbelieving people." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, tumiminie subira, na uifanye imara miguu yetu, na utunusuru dhidi ya watu makafiri.",
        "Our Lord, do not take us to task if we forget or make a mistake." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, usituchukulie tukisahau au tukakosea.",
        "Our Lord, do not place on us a heavy burden like the one You placed on those before us." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, usitutwike mzigo mzito kama ule uliowatwisha waliokuwa kabla yetu.",
        "Our Lord, do not burden us with what we have no strength to bear. Pardon us, forgive us and have mercy on us. You are our Protector, so help us against the disbelieving people." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, usitubebeshe kwa yale ambayo hatuna uwezo nayo. Utusamehe, utusamehe na utuhurumie. Wewe ndiye Mlinzi wetu, basi tusaidie dhidi ya watu makafiri.",
        "Our Lord, do not let our hearts deviate after You have guided us, and grant us mercy from Yourself. Surely You are the Bestower." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, usizipotoe nyoyo zetu baada ya kutuongoza, na utupe rehema itokayo kwako. Hakika Wewe ndiye Mpaji.",
        "Our Lord, You will surely gather all people on a Day about which there is no doubt. Surely Allah does not break His promise." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, bila ya shaka utawakusanya watu wote Siku isiyo na shaka. Hakika Mwenyezi Mungu havunji ahadi yake.",
        "Our Lord, we have believed, so forgive us our sins and save us from the punishment of the Fire." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, tumeamini, basi tusamehe madhambi yetu na utuepushe na adhabu ya Moto.",
        "Our Lord, we believe in what You have revealed and we follow the Messenger, so write us among those who bear witness." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, tumeamini uliyo yateremsha na tunamfuata Mtume, basi tuandikie miongoni mwa wanao shuhudia.",
        "Our Lord, forgive us our sins and our excesses in our affairs, make our feet firm, and help us against the disbelieving people." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, tughufirie madhambi yetu na kupita kiasi kwetu katika mambo yetu, na uifanye imara miguu yetu, na utusaidie dhidi ya watu makafiri.",
        "Our Lord, You have not created this without purpose. Glory be to You, so save us from the punishment of the Fire." to "Mola wetu, hukuumba haya bila kusudi. Umetakasika, basi tuepushe na adhabu ya Moto.",
        "Our Lord, whoever You admit to the Fire, You have surely disgraced him, and the wrongdoers have no helpers." to "Mola wetu, Utakayemuingiza Motoni, hakika umemdhalilisha, na madhalimu hawana wa kuwanusuru.",
        "Our Lord, we heard a caller calling to faith, saying: Believe in your Lord, so we believed." to "Mola wetu Mlezi tumemsikia mwitaji akiita kwenye Imani akisema: Muaminini Mola wenu Mlezi, basi tukaamini.",
        "Our Lord, forgive us our sins, remove from us our misdeeds, and let us die with the righteous." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, tusamehe madhambi yetu, na utuondolee maovu yetu, na tufe pamoja na watu wema.",
        "Our Lord, grant us what You promised us through Your messengers, and do not disgrace us on the Day of Resurrection. Surely You do not break Your promise." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, tupe uliyotuahidi kupitia Mitume wako, wala usitufedheheshe Siku ya Kiyama. Hakika Wewe huvunji ahadi yako.",
        "Our Lord, we have believed, so write us among those who bear witness." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, tumeamini, basi tuandikie miongoni mwa wanao shuhudia.",
        "Our Lord, send down to us a table spread from heaven, to be a festival for the first of us and the last of us and a sign from You. Provide for us, for You are the best of providers." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, tuteremshie meza iliyotandikwa kutoka mbinguni, ili iwe sikukuu kwa wa mwanzo wetu na wa mwisho wetu, na ni Ishara kutoka Kwako. Turuzuku, kwani Wewe ndiye mbora wa wanao ruzuku.",
        "Our Lord, we have wronged ourselves. If You do not forgive us and have mercy on us, we will surely be among the losers." to "Mola wetu Mlezi tumejidhulumu nafsi zetu. Usipotusamehe na ukaturehemu, bila shaka tutakuwa miongoni mwa waliokhasirika.",
        "Our Lord, do not place us with the wrongdoing people." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, usituweke pamoja na watu madhalimu.",
        "Our Lord, decide between us and our people with truth, for You are the best of those who decide." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, tuhukumu baina yetu na watu wetu kwa haki, kwani Wewe ndiye mbora wa wanao amua.",
        "Our Lord, pour patience upon us and let us die as Muslims." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, tumiminie subira na tufe tukiwa Waislamu.",
        "Our Lord, do not make us a trial for the wrongdoing people, and save us by Your mercy from the disbelieving people." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, usitufanye kuwa mtihani kwa watu madhalimu, na utuokoe kwa rehema yako na watu makafiri.",
        "Our Lord, You surely know what we conceal and what we reveal. Nothing on earth or in heaven is hidden from Allah." to "Mola wetu Mlezi! Wewe unajua tunayo yaficha na tunayo yatangaza. Hakuna kilichofichika kwa Mwenyezi Mungu ardhini wala mbinguni.",
        "My Lord, make me one who establishes prayer, and my descendants too. Our Lord, accept my supplication." to "Mola wangu Mlezi, nijaalie niwe mwenye kusimamisha Sala, na dhuria wangu pia. Mola wetu Mlezi, nikubalie dua yangu.",
        "Our Lord, forgive me, my parents and the believers on the Day when the reckoning is established." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, nighufirie mimi na wazazi wangu wawili na Waumini Siku itapo simama hisabu.",
        "Our Lord, grant us mercy from Yourself and provide for us right guidance in our affair." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, tupe rehema kutoka kwako na utupe uwongofu katika mambo yetu.",
        "Our Lord, we fear that he may hasten to harm us or that he may transgress." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, tunachelea asije akatufanyia maovu au akavuka mipaka.",
        "Our Lord, we have believed, so forgive us and have mercy on us, for You are the best of the merciful." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, tumeamini, basi tusamehe na uturehemu, kwani Wewe ndiye mbora wa wanaorehemu.",
        "Our Lord, turn away from us the punishment of Hell. Its punishment is truly unrelenting; it is indeed an evil abode and resting place." to "Mola wetu Mlezi tuepushe na adhabu ya Jahannamu. Adhabu yake kwa kweli ni isiyo na kikomo; Hakika hayo ni makazi mabaya na pastarehe.",
        "Our Lord, grant us from our spouses and our children the coolness of our eyes, and make us leaders of the God-fearing." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, tujaalie kutoka kwa wake zetu na watoto wetu ubaridi wa macho yetu, na utujaalie kuwa viongozi wa wachamngu.",
        "Surely our Lord is All-Forgiving, Most Appreciative." to "Hakika Mola wetu Mlezi ni Msamehevu, Mwenye shukrani.",
        "Our Lord, You encompass everything in mercy and knowledge, so forgive those who repent and follow Your path, and save them from the punishment of Hell." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, Wewe umekizunguka kila kitu katika rehema na elimu, basi wasamehe walio tubu na wakafuata njia yako, na uwaokoe na adhabu ya Jahannamu.",
        "Our Lord, admit them to the Gardens of Eternity which You have promised them, along with the righteous among their parents, spouses and children. Surely You are the Almighty, the All-Wise. And protect them from evil deeds; whoever You protect from evil that Day, You have truly shown him mercy, and that is the supreme success." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, waingize katika Pepo za milele ulizo waahidi, pamoja na wema miongoni mwa wazazi wao na wake zao na watoto wao. Hakika Wewe ni Mwenye nguvu, Mwenye hikima. Na uwalinde na maovu; Utakayemlinda na shari Siku hiyo, hakika umemrehemu, na huko ndiko kufaulu kukubwa.",
        "Our Lord, forgive us and our brothers who preceded us in faith, and do not place in our hearts any ill-will towards those who believe." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, tusamehe sisi na ndugu zetu walio tutangulia kwa Imani, wala usijaalie katika nyoyo zetu chuki kwa walio amini.",
        "Our Lord, surely You are Most Kind, Most Merciful." to "Mola wetu, hakika Wewe ni Mpole, Mwenye kurehemu.",
        "Our Lord, in You we put our trust, to You we turn, and to You is the final return." to "Mola wetu Mlezi tumekutegemea, Kwako tunaelekea, na kwako ndio marejeo.",
        "Our Lord, do not make us a trial for those who disbelieve, and forgive us, our Lord. Surely You are the Almighty, the All-Wise." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, usitufanye kuwa mtihani kwa walio kufuru, na utusamehe Mola wetu Mlezi. Hakika Wewe ni Mwenye nguvu, Mwenye hikima.",
        "Our Lord, perfect our light for us and forgive us. Surely You have power over all things." to "Mola wetu Mlezi, tutimizie nuru yetu na utusamehe. Hakika Wewe ni Muweza juu ya kila kitu.",
        "Sahih al-Bukhari 2736, Sahih Muslim 2677" to "Sahih al-Bukhari 2736, Sahih Muslim 2677",
        "Sahih al-Bukhari 3532, Sahih Muslim 2354" to "Sahih al-Bukhari 3532, Sahih Muslim 2354",
        "The rak‘at below follow the Hanafi teaching. Fard is obligatory; Sunnah Muakkadah should not be left without an excuse; Sunnah Ghair-Muakkadah and Nafl are optional and rewarded." to "Rakaa iliyo hapa chini inafuata mafundisho ya Hanafi. Fard ni wajibu; Sunnah Muakkadah isiachwe bila ya udhuru; Sunnah Ghair-Muakkadah na Nafl ni chaguo na thawabu.",
        "In congregation the imam recites aloud in Fajr, in the first two rak‘at of Maghrib and Isha, and in Jumu‘ah and Eid. Zuhr and Asr are quiet. Praying alone, you may recite quietly in all of them." to "Katika mkusanyiko imamu husoma kwa sauti katika Alfajiri, katika rakaa mbili za mwanzo za Maghrib na Isha, na katika Jumu‘ah na Idi. Zuhr na Asr wako kimya. Kuomba peke yako, unaweza kukariri kwa utulivu katika zote.",
        "Whoever prays twelve rak‘at of Sunnah in a day and night, a house is built for him in Paradise." to "Mwenye kuswali rakaa kumi na mbili za Sunnah mchana na usiku, atajengewa nyumba Peponi.",
        "Prayer times are on Home, and you can log your prayers in the Prayer tracker. This guide does not change your prayer-time calculation." to "Nyakati za maombi ziko Nyumbani, na unaweza kuweka maombi yako kwenye kifuatiliaji cha Maombi. Mwongozo huu haubadilishi hesabu yako ya wakati wa maombi.",
        "This sequence of Sunnah and Nafl is the Hanafi teaching. Other schools may classify or arrange some of them differently." to "Mfuatano huu wa Sunnah na Nafl ni mafundisho ya Hanafi. Shule zingine zinaweza kuainisha au kupanga baadhi yao kwa njia tofauti.",
        "This guide teaches the method; have your recitation and postures checked by a qualified teacher. Rulings follow Hanafi fiqh (Bahar-e-Shariat, Hissa 3)." to "Mwongozo huu unafundisha njia; hakiki usomaji wako na mikao na mwalimu aliyehitimu. Hukumu zinafuata fiqh ya Hanafi (Bahar-e-Shariat, Hissa 3).",
        "Detailed rulings and exceptions depend on your circumstances and school. Ask a reliable Sunni scholar when unsure." to "Maamuzi ya kina na vighairi hutegemea hali na shule yako. Muulize mwanachuoni anayetegemewa wa Kisunni wakati huna uhakika.",
